      "title_en": "Today, I inaugurated the rejuvenated #ThammidikuntaLake in Madhapur, expanding it from 14 acres to 30 acres and dedicating it to the people. Hyderabad’s identity must extend beyond its impressive skyline. Its lakes, green spaces and natural ecosystems are equally integral to the city’s character and",
      "title_zh": "特伦甘纳首席部长：海得拉巴一湖泊从14英亩扩到30英亩后重新开放",
      "summary_en": "Today, I inaugurated the rejuvenated #ThammidikuntaLake in Madhapur, expanding it from 14 acres to 30 acres and dedicating it to the people.\n\nHyderabad’s identity must extend beyond its impressive skyline. Its lakes, green spaces and natural ecosystems are equally integral to the city’s character and future. We cannot allow these precious water bodies to disappear while families continue to suffer from urban flooding even after brief spells of rainfall. \n\nOur vision is to restore the Musi, and transform #Hyderabad into a truly world-class global city — one that balances economic progress with environmental responsibility.",
      "summary_zh": "特伦甘纳邦首席部长雷万斯·雷迪称，他为海得拉巴Madhapur修复后的Thammidikunta湖揭幕，湖面从14英亩扩大到30英亩，并表示城市不能让水体消失、居民却在短时降雨后就遭受内涝，目标是恢复穆西河。",
