        "lang": "en",
        "text": "Today, I inaugurated the rejuvenated #ThammidikuntaLake in Madhapur, expanding it from 14 acres to 30 acres and dedicating it to the people.\n\nHyderabad’s identity must extend beyond its impressive skyline. Its lakes, green spaces and natural ecosystems are equally integral to the city’s character and future. We cannot allow these precious water bodies to disappear while families continue to suffer from urban flooding even after brief spells of rainfall. \n\nOur vision is to restore the Musi, and transform #Hyderabad into a truly world-class global city — one that balances economic progress with environmental responsibility.",
