      "id": "2d8a0e1e9ed1b52d",
      "url": "https://x.com/narendramodi/status/2120552910933405942",
      "title_en": "Imagine New Delhi becoming home to the world’s largest museum display area? Think scale. Think culture. That is the vision behind the Yuge Yugeen Bharat Museum! Today’s Cabinet decision will give impetus to transform historic North and South Block buildings into a magnificent celebration of Bharat’s",
      "title_zh": "莫迪：北区、南区秘书处大楼将改建为“世界最大展陈面积”博物馆",
      "summary_en": "Imagine New Delhi becoming home to the world’s largest museum display area?\n\nThink scale. Think culture. \n\nThat is the vision behind the Yuge Yugeen Bharat Museum!\n\nToday’s Cabinet decision will give impetus to transform historic North and South Block buildings into a magnificent celebration of Bharat’s civilisational journey.\n\nFrom ancient knowledge systems, mathematics and astronomy to architecture, art, languages and spirituality, the museum will bring thousands of years of our heritage to life through immersive experiences and world-class galleries.\n\nBuildings that have been centres of governance will now become a place where millions can discover, experience and celebrate the timeless richness of our civilisation.\n\nA historic new chapter for India’s cultural heritage!\n\nhttps://t.co/lV7gjJ0iXk*",
      "summary_zh": "印度总理莫迪发帖称，内阁当天的决定将推动把新德里历史悠久的北区和南区秘书处大楼改造成“Yuge Yugeen Bharat”博物馆，号称将拥有世界最大的博物馆展陈面积，用沉浸式展厅呈现印度数千年的知识、数学、天文、建筑、艺术、语言与宗教传统。",
